<title>UK: SmithKline allowed to sell Denavir in U.S.</title>
<headline>SmithKline allowed to sell Denavir in U.S.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>SmithKline Beecham said on Wednesday it received approval from the U.S. Food and Drug Adminstration (FDA) to market Denavir, a treatment against recurrent cold sores.  </p>
<p>Denavir was the first and only topical antiviral cream to be cleared by the FDA for this indication, SmithKline said.</p>
<p>The drug will be available on prescription.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
